From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:51:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] download: preserve complete transport streams when local HLS
 mux fails

Cached HLS can contain malformed AAC that also stops full audio transcoding. Keep the original packets in a duration-checked TS on compatible mux failures and use the same retry and verified-copy flow.
